english.UpgradeExistingVersion=Installed version:
english.UpgradeTargetVersion=Target version:
english.UpgradeSetupManaged=Setup will upgrade or repair AgentDock and preserve the current startup, connection, tasks, Skills, and configuration.
english.UpgradeLegacyManaged=An existing PowerShell installation was found. Setup will migrate it to the graphical installer and preserve the current startup, connection, tasks, Skills, and configuration.
english.InstallDirectoryInUse=AgentDock is installed in the folder below. Use that folder to upgrade. To choose a different folder, uninstall the current installation while keeping user data, then run Setup again.
english.ReadyUpgrade=Setup is ready to upgrade or repair AgentDock.
english.OfflineProgressCaption=Installing AgentDock
english.OfflineProgressDescription=Setup is configuring AgentDock. Please wait while installation completes.
english.OfflineProgressPreparing=Preparing AgentDock...
english.OfflineProgressApplying=Installing AgentDock and applying your settings...
english.OfflineProgressFinishing=Starting AgentDock and checking its status...
english.FinishedControlPanel=AgentDock installation is complete. Click Finish to open AgentDock Control Panel. You can also open it later from the Start menu or system tray.
english.FinishedDeferredControlPanel=AgentDock installation is complete. Windows did not complete immediate runtime activation or verification. Startup settings were saved; open AgentDock from the Start menu or sign in to Windows again to retry.
